# CAST OSS Vulnerability Remediation

This rule activates the four-step OSS remediation workflow powered by CAST Highlight
and CAST Imaging. The full workflow logic is in `skills/oss-vuln-remediation.md`.

## Quick start

Run these four commands in order in the same Cursor Composer session:

1. `@app-resolver <AppName>` — resolve app identity (run once per session)
2. `@oss-assessment` — scan for vulnerabilities → writes `oss_remediation_plan.md`
3. `@oss-dependency-prescan` — enrich plan with Imaging blast radius + exec order
4. `@oss-remediation` — fix each component with build validation

## MCP server setup

Add to `.cursor/mcp.json` (project) or `~/.cursor/mcp.json` (global):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "highlight": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://<your-highlight-mcp-host>/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "highlight_domain": "<your-domain-id>",
        "highlight_api_key": "<your-highlight-api-key>"
      }
    },
    "imaging": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://<your-imaging-host>:<port>/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "x-api-key": "<your-imaging-api-key>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Replace each `<placeholder>` with your actual values.

