## Key behavioural rules

- One component at a time — never batch fixes.
- Build after every fix — rollback on failure.
- Maximum 3 build runs per component.
- Never guess context values — stop and report if any resolved identity is missing.
- Never fix LICENSE-only or OUTDATED-only items unless explicitly instructed.
- Workspace code is ground truth when Imaging returns no results.
